        {
          "id": 606301833,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "One additional thing. Never should we add stuff to tooltips, which may be programm-code. In this case, the separator may change. If this code stays in, it should at least be more generic and take the separator from the appropriate internal define, instead of being hard-coded!",
