        {
          "id": 606690991,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "`#define PARENT_SEPARATOR \"//\"`  \nMove the `#define` from [filter_expression_toolbar.cpp](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/ui/qt/widgets/filter_expression_toolbar.cpp) to [filter_expressions.h](https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/filter_expressions.h)? Looks like both `cpp` files include it.\n  \nShould the string in the `.ui` file be empty and set it fully in the equivalent `.cpp` file?",
